      "expected_ref_state": ["found"],
      "counts_as_validator_defect_if_found": false,
      "known_limit": true,
      "why": "validate_query converts to text and returns it: it validates nothing. A needle on the call or def line is on a code line, so the structural reference check reports found. That is a stated limit of the check (it proves a line exists, not that it works); the scorer lists a credit here as a known limit, not a defect."
