  "match_rule": "A model threat matches an expected threat when its STRIDE category equals category and its element resolves to the element, or the (element, category) is in accept. An element resolves by id only inside the model that defined it, so the scorer maps model components to expected ones by name_hints and by path/anchor overlap (a component whose refs sit within 40 lines of an anchor), and model flows by their resolved endpoints. Matching is one-to-one."
